{% doc %}
  @prompt
    Use this detailed **Shopify AI prompt** to generate the section in your Shopify theme. It's written specifically to match your **RootSyntax** design language, color palette, spacing, and premium UI.
    
    ---
    
    # Shopify AI Prompt – Premium Contact Us Section (RootSyntax Theme)
    
    Create a premium, modern **Contact Us** section for a Shopify store that perfectly matches the existing RootSyntax website design. The section should feel like a natural continuation of the homepage with a luxury SaaS aesthetic, using a dark background, orange highlights, subtle purple glows, rounded glass cards, and smooth animations.
    
    ## Overall Layout
    
    * Maximum width: 1400px
    * Desktop: Two-column layout (65% form / 35% contact information)
    * Mobile: Stack cards vertically
    * Section spacing: 100px top & bottom
    * Gap between columns: 32px
    * Background: #050505 with subtle animated orange and purple radial glow in the corners
    * Fully responsive
    * Editable via Shopify Theme Editor
    
    ---
    
    # Left Card – Contact Form
    
    Use a premium glassmorphism card.
    
    ### Card Style
    
    * Background: rgba(15,15,18,0.95)
    * Border: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.08)
    * Border Radius: 24px
    * Padding: 40px
    * Soft orange and purple glow around the card
    * Slight blur effect
    
    ---
    
    ### Badge
    
    Small pill badge
    
    📩 Get In Touch
    
    Background:
    Dark gray
    
    Border:
    Orange
    
    ---
    
    ### Heading
    
    Large bold heading
    
    **Let's Build Your Shopify Success**
    
    Highlight only
    
    **Shopify Success**
    
    using a gradient
    
    #FF7A00 → #FF9D2F
    
    Font size
    
    52px desktop
    
    34px mobile
    
    Weight
    
    700
    
    ---
    
    ### Description
    
    Tell us about your project and our Shopify experts will get back within one business day.
    
    Muted gray
    
    18px
    
    ---
    
    # Form Fields
    
    All inputs should have:
    
    * Dark background (#111)
    * Rounded 14px corners
    * 54px height
    * White text
    * Gray placeholder
    * Orange border on focus
    * Orange glow on focus
    * Smooth 0.3s animation
    
    ---
    
    ### Row 1
    
    * Full Name
    * Business Email
    
    ---
    
    ### Row 2
    
    * Phone Number
    * Company Name
    
    ---
    
    ### Row 3
    
    Dropdown
    
    Service Interested In
    
    Options
    
    * Shopify Store Setup
    * Shopify Migration
    * Shopify Plus Development
    * Shopify Redesign
    * CRO Optimization
    * Custom Shopify Development
    * Website Audit
    
    ---
    
    ### Row 4
    
    Dropdown
    
    Estimated Budget
    
    Options
    
    * Under $2,000
    * $2,000–5,000
    * $5,000–10,000
    * $10,000+
    
    ---
    
    ### Timeline
    
    Instead of radio buttons create premium selectable pills.
    
    Four options
    
    ⚡ ASAP
    
    🕒 1–2 Weeks
    
    📅 1 Month
    
    🚀 2–3 Months
    
    Selected state
    
    Orange border
    
    Orange glow
    
    Dark orange background
    
    White text
    
    ---
    
    ### Project Details
    
    Large textarea
    
    Placeholder
    
    Tell us about your business, goals, competitors, or existing Shopify store...
    
    Minimum height
    
    180px
    
    Character counter in bottom right
    
    ---
    
    ### Schedule Call (Optional)
    
    Three equal-width fields
    
    * Select Date
    * Select Time
    * Timezone
    
    Dark dropdown styling
    
    Calendar and clock icons
    
    ---
    
    ### Submit Button
    
    Full width
    
    Height
    
    60px
    
    Large rounded corners
    
    Gradient
    
    Left
    
    #FF7A00
    
    Right
    
    #6C4CFF
    
    Hover
    
    Slight lift
    
    Gradient animation
    
    Orange shadow
    
    Button text
    
    **Start My Project**
    
    Arrow icon on right
    
    ---
    
    ### Consent Checkbox
    
    Dark checkbox
    
    Orange when checked
    
    Small gray text
    
    Privacy Policy link in orange
    
    ---
    
    # Right Card
    
    Create a matching premium glass card.
    
    Same styling as left card.
    
    ---
    
    ## Heading
    
    Large heading
    
    **We'd Love To Hear From You**
    
    White
    
    48px
    
    ---
    
    ## Response Time Card
    
    Small glass card
    
    ⚡ icon
    
    Average response time
    
    **Within 24 Hours**
    
    Orange text
    
    ---
    
    ## Working Hours
    
    🕒
    
    Monday – Friday
    
    9:30 AM – 4 PM EST
    
    ---
    
    ## Email
    
    ✉️
    
    [hello@rootsyntax.com](mailto:hello@rootsyntax.com)
    
    Orange hover effect
    
    ---
    
    ## Phone
    
    📞
    
    +1 352-218-5661
    
    ---
    
    # Offices
    
    Create two premium location cards.
    
    ### USA
    
    🇺🇸
    
    Ocala, Florida
    
    Saint Petersburg, Florida
    
    Right arrow icon
    
    ---
    
    ### India
    
    🇮🇳
    
    Mahadevapura
    
    Bangalore
    
    Right arrow icon
    
    ---
    
    # Social Icons
    
    Display in one row.
    
    * LinkedIn
    * Instagram
    * Facebook
    * X
    * GitHub
    
    Rounded square buttons
    
    Dark background
    
    Purple border
    
    Hover
    
    Orange glow
    
    Scale to 1.05
    
    ---
    
    # Trust Card
    
    Bottom card
    
    ★★★★★
    
    Large text
    
    **146+ Shopify Projects Delivered**
    
    Small text
    
    98% Client Satisfaction
    
    Bottom animated gradient progress line
    
    Orange → Purple
    
    ---
    
    # Animations
    
    On scroll
    
    * Fade Up
    * Duration: 600ms
    
    Cards
    
    * Lift 8px on hover
    * Stronger border glow
    
    Inputs
    
    * Orange border on focus
    * Smooth transition
    
    Buttons
    
    * Gradient animation
    * Glow effect
    
    ---
    
    # Shopify Theme Settings
    
    Make all content editable from the Theme Editor:
    
    * Section heading
    * Description
    * Badge text
    * Button text
    * Email
    * Phone
    * Working hours
    * Office locations
    * Social links
    * Service dropdown options
    * Budget dropdown options
    * Timeline options
    * Response time text
    * Trust badge numbers
    * Background glow toggle
    * Gradient colors
    * Border radius
    * Card spacing
    * Show or hide Schedule Call fields
    
    ---
    
    ## Design Goal
    
    The final section should look like it was designed specifically for the RootSyntax website, matching the premium black theme with orang
{% enddoc %}
{% assign ai_gen_id = block.id | replace: '_', '' | downcase %}

{% style %}
  .ai-contact-section-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    display: block;
    width: 100%;
    background: {{ block.settings.background_color }};
    padding: {{ block.settings.section_padding_top }}px 20px {{ block.settings.section_padding_bottom }}px;
    position: relative;
    overflow: hidden;
  }

  {% if block.settings.show_background_glow %}
    .ai-contact-section-{{ ai_gen_id }}::before {
      content: '';
      position: absolute;
      top: -200px;
      left: -200px;
      width: 400px;
      height: 400px;
      background: radial-gradient(circle, rgba(255, 122, 0, 0.15) 0%, transparent 70%);
      pointer-events: none;
      animation: ai-glow-pulse-{{ ai_gen_id }} 8s ease-in-out infinite;
    }

    .ai-contact-section-{{ ai_gen_id }}::after {
      content: '';
      position: absolute;
      bottom: -200px;
      right: -200px;
      width: 400px;
      height: 400px;
      background: radial-gradient(circle, rgba(108, 76, 255, 0.15) 0%, transparent 70%);
      pointer-events: none;
      animation: ai-glow-pulse-{{ ai_gen_id }} 8s ease-in-out infinite reverse;
    }

    @keyframes ai-glow-pulse-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
      0%, 100% { opacity: 0.5; }
      50% { opacity: 1; }
    }
  {% endif %}

  .ai-contact-container-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    max-width: 1400px;
    margin: 0 auto;
    position: relative;
    z-index: 1;
  }

  .ai-contact-grid-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: 1fr;
    gap: 32px;
  }

  @media (min-width: 990px) {
    .ai-contact-grid-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
      grid-template-columns: 65% 35%;
    }
  }

  .ai-contact-card-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    background: {{ block.settings.card_background }};
    border: 1px solid {{ block.settings.card_border_color }};
    border-radius: {{ block.settings.card_border_radius }}px;
    padding: 40px;
    backdrop-filter: blur(10px);
    box-shadow: 0 8px 32px rgba(255, 122, 0, 0.1), 0 4px 16px rgba(108, 76, 255, 0.08);
    transition: transform 0.3s ease, box-shadow 0.3s ease;
  }

  .ai-contact-card-{{ ai_gen_id }}:hover {
    transform: translateY(-8px);
    box-shadow: 0 12px 48px rgba(255, 122, 0, 0.15), 0 6px 24px rgba(108, 76, 255, 0.12);
  }

  .ai-contact-badge-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    display: inline-flex;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 8px;
    padding: 8px 16px;
    background: {{ block.settings.badge_background }};
    border: 1px solid {{ block.settings.badge_border_color }};
    border-radius: 100px;
    font-size: 14px;
    color: {{ block.settings.badge_text_color }};
    margin-bottom: 24px;
  }

  .ai-contact-heading-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    font-size: 52px;
    font-weight: 700;
    line-height: 1.1;
    color: {{ block.settings.heading_color }};
    margin: 0 0 16px;
  }

  .ai-contact-heading-highlight-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    background: linear-gradient(135deg, {{ block.settings.gradient_start }} 0%, {{ block.settings.gradient_end }} 100%);
    -webkit-background-clip: text;
    -webkit-text-fill-color: transparent;
    background-clip: text;
  }

  .ai-contact-description-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    font-size: 18px;
    line-height: 1.6;
    color: {{ block.settings.description_color }};
    margin: 0 0 32px;
  }

  .ai-contact-form-row-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: 1fr;
    gap: 16px;
    margin-bottom: 16px;
  }

  @media (min-width: 750px) {
    .ai-contact-form-row-{{ ai_gen_id }}.ai-contact-form-row-two-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
      grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr;
    }

    .ai-contact-form-row-{{ ai_gen_id }}.ai-contact-form-row-three-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
      grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr 1fr;
    }
  }

  .ai-contact-input-{{ ai_gen_id }},
  .ai-contact-select-{{ ai_gen_id }},
  .ai-contact-textarea-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    width: 100%;
    height: 54px;
    padding: 0 20px;
    background: {{ block.settings.input_background }};
    border: 1px solid {{ block.settings.input_border_color }};
    border-radius: 14px;
    color: {{ block.settings.input_text_color }};
    font-size: 16px;
    transition: all 0.3s ease;
  }

  .ai-contact-input-{{ ai_gen_id }}::placeholder,
  .ai-contact-select-{{ ai_gen_id }}::placeholder,
  .ai-contact-textarea-{{ ai_gen_id }}::placeholder {
    color: {{ block.settings.input_placeholder_color }};
  }

  .ai-contact-input-{{ ai_gen_id }}:focus,
  .ai-contact-select-{{ ai_gen_id }}:focus,
  .ai-contact-textarea-{{ ai_gen_id }}:focus {
    outline: none;
    border-color: {{ block.settings.input_focus_border }};
    box-shadow: 0 0 0 3px {{ block.settings.input_focus_glow }};
  }

  .ai-contact-select-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    appearance: none;
    background-image: url("data:image/svg+xml,%3Csvg width='12' height='8' viewBox='0 0 12 8' fill='none' xmlns='http://www.w3.org/2000/svg'%3E%3Cpath d='M1 1L6 6L11 1' stroke='%23999' stroke-width='2' stroke-linecap='round'/%3E%3C/svg%3E");
    background-repeat: no-repeat;
    background-position: right 20px center;
    padding-right: 50px;
  }

  .ai-contact-textarea-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    height: auto;
    min-height: 180px;
    padding: 20px;
    resize: vertical;
  }

  .ai-contact-timeline-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: 1fr;
    gap: 12px;
    margin-bottom: 16px;
  }

  @media (min-width: 750px) {
    .ai-contact-timeline-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
      grid-template-columns: repeat(4, 1fr);
    }
  }

  .ai-contact-timeline-label-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    font-size: 14px;
    font-weight: 600;
    color: {{ block.settings.heading_color }};
    margin-bottom: 12px;
    display: block;
  }

  .ai-contact-timeline-option-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    position: relative;
  }

  .ai-contact-timeline-input-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    position: absolute;
    opacity: 0;
    pointer-events: none;
  }

  .ai-contact-timeline-pill-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    justify-content: center;
    gap: 6px;
    padding: 12px 16px;
    background: {{ block.settings.input_background }};
    border: 1px solid {{ block.settings.input_border_color }};
    border-radius: 14px;
    color: {{ block.settings.input_text_color }};
    font-size: 14px;
    cursor: pointer;
    transition: all 0.3s ease;
    text-align: center;
  }

  .ai-contact-timeline-input-{{ ai_gen_id }}:checked + .ai-contact-timeline-pill-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    background: {{ block.settings.timeline_selected_bg }};
    border-color: {{ block.settings.input_focus_border }};
    color: {{ block.settings.timeline_selected_text }};
    box-shadow: 0 0 0 3px {{ block.settings.input_focus_glow }};
  }

  .ai-contact-timeline-pill-{{ ai_gen_id }}:hover {
    border-color: {{ block.settings.input_focus_border }};
  }

  .ai-contact-char-counter-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    text-align: right;
    font-size: 12px;
    color: {{ block.settings.input_placeholder_color }};
    margin-top: 8px;
  }

  .ai-contact-submit-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    width: 100%;
    height: 60px;
    padding: 0 32px;
    background: linear-gradient(135deg, {{ block.settings.button_gradient_start }} 0%, {{ block.settings.button_gradient_end }} 100%);
    border: none;
    border-radius: 14px;
    color: {{ block.settings.button_text_color }};
    font-size: 18px;
    font-weight: 700;
    cursor: pointer;
    transition: all 0.3s ease;
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    justify-content: center;
    gap: 12px;
    box-shadow: 0 4px 16px {{ block.settings.button_shadow }};
  }

  .ai-contact-submit-{{ ai_gen_id }}:hover {
    transform: translateY(-2px);
    box-shadow: 0 8px 24px {{ block.settings.button_shadow }};
  }

  .ai-contact-checkbox-wrapper-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    display: flex;
    align-items: flex-start;
    gap: 12px;
    margin-top: 16px;
  }

  .ai-contact-checkbox-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    width: 20px;
    height: 20px;
    border: 1px solid {{ block.settings.input_border_color }};
    border-radius: 4px;
    cursor: pointer;
    flex-shrink: 0;
    margin-top: 2px;
    accent-color: {{ block.settings.input_focus_border }};
  }

  .ai-contact-checkbox-label-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    font-size: 14px;
    color: {{ block.settings.input_placeholder_color }};
    line-height: 1.5;
  }

  .ai-contact-checkbox-label-{{ ai_gen_id }} a {
    color: {{ block.settings.input_focus_border }};
    text-decoration: none;
  }

  .ai-contact-checkbox-label-{{ ai_gen_id }} a:hover {
    text-decoration: underline;
  }

  .ai-contact-info-heading-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    font-size: 48px;
    font-weight: 700;
    line-height: 1.2;
    color: {{ block.settings.heading_color }};
    margin: 0 0 24px;
  }

  .ai-contact-response-card-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    background: {{ block.settings.info_card_background }};
    border: 1px solid {{ block.settings.card_border_color }};
    border-radius: 12px;
    padding: 20px;
    margin-bottom: 24px;
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 16px;
  }

  .ai-contact-response-icon-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    font-size: 32px;
  }

  .ai-contact-response-label-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    font-size: 14px;
    color: {{ block.settings.description_color }};
    margin: 0 0 4px;
  }

  .ai-contact-response-value-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    font-size: 18px;
    font-weight: 700;
    color: {{ block.settings.input_focus_border }};
    margin: 0;
  }

  .ai-contact-info-item-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 12px;
    padding: 16px 0;
    border-bottom: 1px solid {{ block.settings.card_border_color }};
  }

  .ai-contact-info-item-{{ ai_gen_id }}:last-child {
    border-bottom: none;
  }

  .ai-contact-info-icon-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    font-size: 20px;
  }

  .ai-contact-info-text-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    flex: 1;
  }

  .ai-contact-info-label-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    font-size: 12px;
    color: {{ block.settings.description_color }};
    margin: 0 0 4px;
  }

  .ai-contact-info-value-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    font-size: 16px;
    color: {{ block.settings.heading_color }};
    margin: 0;
  }

  .ai-contact-info-value-{{ ai_gen_id }} a {
    color: {{ block.settings.heading_color }};
    text-decoration: none;
    transition: color 0.3s ease;
  }

  .ai-contact-info-value-{{ ai_gen_id }} a:hover {
    color: {{ block.settings.input_focus_border }};
  }

  .ai-contact-offices-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    margin: 24px 0;
  }

  .ai-contact-office-card-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    background: {{ block.settings.info_card_background }};
    border: 1px solid {{ block.settings.card_border_color }};
    border-radius: 12px;
    padding: 20px;
    margin-bottom: 16px;
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    justify-content: space-between;
    cursor: pointer;
    transition: all 0.3s ease;
  }

  .ai-contact-office-card-{{ ai_gen_id }}:hover {
    border-color: {{ block.settings.input_focus_border }};
    transform: translateX(4px);
  }

  .ai-contact-office-content-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 12px;
  }

  .ai-contact-office-flag-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    font-size: 32px;
  }

  .ai-contact-office-name-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    font-size: 16px;
    font-weight: 700;
    color: {{ block.settings.heading_color }};
    margin: 0 0 4px;
  }

  .ai-contact-office-location-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    font-size: 14px;
    color: {{ block.settings.description_color }};
    margin: 0;
  }

  .ai-contact-office-arrow-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    font-size: 20px;
    color: {{ block.settings.description_color }};
  }

  .ai-contact-social-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    display: flex;
    gap: 12px;
    margin: 24px 0;
    flex-wrap: wrap;
  }

  .ai-contact-social-link-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    width: 48px;
    height: 48px;
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    justify-content: center;
    background: {{ block.settings.input_background }};
    border: 1px solid {{ block.settings.badge_border_color }};
    border-radius: 12px;
    color: {{ block.settings.heading_color }};
    text-decoration: none;
    transition: all 0.3s ease;
  }

  .ai-contact-social-link-{{ ai_gen_id }}:hover {
    border-color: {{ block.settings.input_focus_border }};
    box-shadow: 0 0 0 3px {{ block.settings.input_focus_glow }};
    transform: scale(1.05);
  }

  .ai-contact-trust-card-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    background: {{ block.settings.info_card_background }};
    border: 1px solid {{ block.settings.card_border_color }};
    border-radius: 12px;
    padding: 24px;
    text-align: center;
    position: relative;
    overflow: hidden;
  }

  .ai-contact-trust-stars-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    font-size: 24px;
    margin-bottom: 12px;
  }

  .ai-contact-trust-number-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    font-size: 32px;
    font-weight: 700;
    color: {{ block.settings.heading_color }};
    margin: 0 0 8px;
  }

  .ai-contact-trust-text-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    font-size: 14px;
    color: {{ block.settings.description_color }};
    margin: 0;
  }

  .ai-contact-trust-progress-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    position: absolute;
    bottom: 0;
    left: 0;
    width: 100%;
    height: 4px;
    background: linear-gradient(90deg, {{ block.settings.gradient_start }} 0%, {{ block.settings.button_gradient_end }} 100%);
    animation: ai-progress-{{ ai_gen_id }} 3s ease-in-out infinite;
  }

  @keyframes ai-progress-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    0%, 100% { transform: translateX(-100%); }
    50% { transform: translateX(100%); }
  }

  @media (max-width: 749px) {
    .ai-contact-heading-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
      font-size: 34px;
    }

    .ai-contact-info-heading-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
      font-size: 32px;
    }

    .ai-contact-card-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
      padding: 24px;
    }
  }
{% endstyle %}

<contact-section-{{ ai_gen_id }} class="ai-contact-section-{{ ai_gen_id }}" {{ block.shopify_attributes }}>
  <div class="ai-contact-container-{{ ai_gen_id }}">
    <div class="ai-contact-grid-{{ ai_gen_id }}">
      <div class="ai-contact-card-{{ ai_gen_id }}">
        {% if block.settings.badge_text != blank %}
          <div class="ai-contact-badge-{{ ai_gen_id }}">
            <span>{{ block.settings.badge_icon }}</span>
            <span>{{ block.settings.badge_text }}</span>
          </div>
        {% endif %}

        {% if block.settings.heading != blank %}
          <h2 class="ai-contact-heading-{{ ai_gen_id }}">
            {{ block.settings.heading_part1 }}
            <span class="ai-contact-heading-highlight-{{ ai_gen_id }}">{{ block.settings.heading_highlight }}</span>
          </h2>
        {% endif %}

        {% if block.settings.description != blank %}
          <p class="ai-contact-description-{{ ai_gen_id }}">{{ block.settings.description }}</p>
        {% endif %}

        {% form 'contact' %}
          {% if form.posted_successfully? %}
            <div style="padding: 20px; background: rgba(0, 128, 96, 0.1); border: 1px solid #008060; border-radius: 14px; margin-bottom: 20px; color: #008060;">
              {{ block.settings.success_message }}
            </div>
          {% endif %}

          {% if form.errors %}
            <div style="padding: 20px; background: rgba(216, 44, 13, 0.1); border: 1px solid #D82C0D; border-radius: 14px; margin-bottom: 20px; color: #D82C0D;">
              {{ form.errors | default_errors }}
            </div>
          {% endif %}

